 (text "Power button latch and logic supplies" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "eaca0dc7-c0b5-5a18-aafb-7106bf58cbb8"))
(text "TPS70933 makes 3V3_AON from B+ (1 uA). SN74LVC1G74 is the on/off latch: button -> PRE, MCU KILL -> CLR." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7438aeee-85cd-5bf4-b947-16e8c1b18d09"))
(text "A reset or crash of the MCU does not turn the car off; only KILL (PB12 high) or pulling the pack does." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "42997831-0ae0-51ef-8f1d-62a4c811fa22"))
(text "LATCH_Q enables the TPS48111 and the DRV8323R buck (nSHDN). Buck: VIN from B+, 5.0 V (54.9k / 10k, 0.765 V FB)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "919cddb4-1bf6-5283-875d-23ff702760ba"))
(text "TLV75533P makes +3V3 from +5V. The button also pulls the charger QON low (exits ship mode)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "f99a446d-e8e4-5bbd-b14f-87d4ccd70770"))
